{"sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","items":[{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k001","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"목부는 물과 무기질을 주로 뿌리에서 잎으로 운반하며 증산에 의한 장력과 물의 응집력이 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k002","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"체관은 source에서 sink로 당을 운반하며 압력류 모형은 당 적재에 따른 삼투적 물 유입과 압력 차이를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k003","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"뿌리 내피의 Casparian strip은 apoplast 이동을 제한한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k004","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"기공의 개폐는 공변세포 이온 이동 및 팽압에 따라 달라진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k005","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"auxin은 신장·굴광성·정아우세, cytokinin은 세포분열 및 노화 지연, gibberellin은 줄기 신장과 발아, ABA는 건조 스트레스·기공 폐쇄·휴면, ethylene은 성숙·노화·탈리와 관련된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k006","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"phytochrome은 적색광과 원적색광에 반응하는 광수용체이며 phototropin은 청색광 반응에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k007","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"피자식물의 중복수정은 접합자와 보통 3배체 배유를 형성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k008","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"목부는 증산·응집-장력, 체관은 source–sink 압력류.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k009","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"ABA는 건조 시 기공 폐쇄를 촉진한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k010","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"auxin 분포의 비대칭은 굴광성 반응에 중요하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"plant--transport-growth-k011","sectionId":"plant/transport-growth","unitId":"plant","subject":"biology","text":"체관이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}